"This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.\n\nBook information is provided by Open Library, a project of the Internet Archive.\n\nTrailers are provided by YouTube and subject to the YouTube Terms of Service.\n\nJellyfin, Emby, Plex, Navidrome, Trakt, Simkl, Jellyseerr, and Overseerr are trademarks of their respective owners. Umbry is not affiliated with them.": "本产品使用 TMDB API，但未经 TMDB 认可或认证。\n\n图书信息由 Internet Archive 旗下项目 Open Library 提供。\n\n预告片由 YouTube 提供，受 YouTube 服务条款约束。\n\nJellyfin、Emby、Plex、Navidrome、Trakt、Simkl、Jellyseerr 和 Overseerr 是其各自所有者的商标。Umbry 与它们没有关联。",
