"Umbry is GPL-2.0 (built on Jellyfin) — download the source": "Umbry 采用 GPL-2.0（基于 Jellyfin）——下载源代码",
"Umbry is an independent app. It plays media from servers you run yourself — Jellyfin, Emby, Plex, and Subsonic-compatible music servers such as Navidrome — and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of them. Design cues inspired by Moonfin. Built entirely with Apple's frameworks; this app contains no third-party code.": "Umbry 是一款独立 App。它播放来自你自己运行的服务器的媒体——Jellyfin、Emby、Plex，以及 Navidrome 等兼容 Subsonic 的音乐服务器——与上述任何一方均无关联，也未获得其认可或赞助。设计灵感来自 Moonfin。完全使用 Apple 的框架构建；此 App 不包含任何第三方代码。",
"Umbry is licensed to you under Apple's Standard Licensed Application End User License Agreement (EULA), which applies to apps obtained through the App Store.\n\nUmbry does not host, sell, or supply any media. It plays content from servers you choose to connect to. You are responsible for that content and for having the rights to stream it.\n\nUmbry is provided \"as is\", without warranties beyond those required by law. Questions: dev@umbry.org": "Umbry 依据 Apple 的标准许可应用程序最终用户许可协议（EULA）授权你使用，该协议适用于通过 App Store 获取的 App。\n\nUmbry 不托管、不销售、也不提供任何媒体内容。它播放的是你选择连接的服务器上的内容。你需对这些内容负责，并确保你拥有流式播放这些内容的权利。\n\nUmbry 按“原样”提供，除法律要求的保证外，不提供任何其他保证。如有疑问：dev@umbry.org",
"Umbry is up to date": "Umbry 已是最新版本",
"Umbry runs on your device and talks directly to the servers you add. It has no analytics, ads, or tracking, and does not collect or sell personal data.\n\nOn this device: your server addresses, the sign-in tokens your servers issue, and your settings. Subsonic music servers and IPTV logins need the password itself to sign each request, so for those the password is stored too.\n\nYour Umbry Server (optional): if you connect one, your Umbry account (email and a hashed password), your media-server list with its sign-in tokens, your watchlist, and your settings sync to it so they follow you to your other devices. The Umbry Server is software you run on your own computer; it encrypts the synced data at rest, and Umbry (the developer) never receives it. Your theme, Trakt/Simkl links, Subsonic and IPTV logins, downloads, and PIN stay on this device. If you choose “Use this device only”, nothing leaves this device.\n\nServices you choose to use:\n• Trakt or Simkl receive what you watch, to keep your history in sync.\n• Jellyseerr or Overseerr receive the requests you make.\n• Additional ratings send a title's TMDB id to TMDB.\n• Trailers load from YouTube.\n• Books → Discover queries Open Library.\n\nQuestions: dev@umbry.org": "Umbry 在你的设备上运行，并直接与你添加的服务器通信。它没有分析、广告或跟踪功能，也不收集或出售个人数据。\n\n在此设备上：你的服务器地址、服务器签发的登录令牌以及你的设置。Subsonic 音乐服务器和 IPTV 登录需要使用密码本身来签署每个请求，因此对于这两者也会存储密码。\n\n你的 Umbry Server（可选）：如果你连接了一台，你的 Umbry 账户（电子邮件和经过哈希处理的密码）、包含登录令牌的媒体服务器列表、你的待看列表以及你的设置会同步到其中，以便在你的其他设备上使用。Umbry Server 是你在自己的电脑上运行的软件；它会对同步的数据进行静态加密，Umbry（开发者）永远不会收到这些数据。你的主题、Trakt/Simkl 关联、Subsonic 和 IPTV 登录、下载内容以及 PIN 均保留在此设备上。如果你选择“仅使用此设备”，则不会有任何数据离开此设备。\n\n你选择使用的服务：\n• Trakt 或 Simkl 会接收你观看的内容，以保持你的观看历史同步。\n• Jellyseerr 或 Overseerr 会接收你提交的请求。\n• 附加评分会将作品的 TMDB ID 发送给 TMDB。\n• 预告片从 YouTube 加载。\n• 图书 → 发现 会查询 Open Library。\n\n如有疑问：dev@umbry.org",
"Umbry works with Navidrome, Airsonic and any Subsonic-API server.": "Umbry 可与 Navidrome、Airsonic 及任何 Subsonic API 服务器配合使用。",
"Umbry — one beautiful player for Jellyfin, Emby and Plex.": "Umbry —— 一款适用于 Jellyfin、Emby 和 Plex 的精美播放器。",
